id: debuffer-maneuver
name: Debuffer
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: debuffer
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spirit of Namek's Debuffer: a Clash (Cognitive) at a Studied Opponent - won, Impediment till the end of this turn.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round]: Debuffer - As an Instant Maneuver, you can target a Studied Opponent. Make a Clash (Cognitive) against them. If you win, they suffer from the Impediment Combat Condition until the end of this turn.

---

# Owned by every character, listed while the Debuffer Option is had (`fromTrait` - an Option counts). Used, which Studied
# Opponent asked, and the Clash opened; won, Impediment on whoever's turn this is's clock (chat.mjs debuff, settleDebuffer).
[on used]
debuff();
